 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports to China increased from 57.4 million euros in 2002 to 231.8 million euros in 2025, while imports from China rose from 73.0 million euros to 761.3 million euros in the same period.",
  "Imports from China grew by 943.1% between 2002 and 2025, a much larger increase than the 304.1% growth in exports to China.",
  "Exports to Japan rose modestly by 25.9% from 45.3 million euros in 2002 to 57.1 million euros in 2025, whereas imports from Japan surged by 729.1% to reach 1.13 billion euros in 2025.",
  "The peak import value from China was in 2008 at 4.07 billion euros, while Japan's imports peaked in 2025 at 1.13 billion euros.",
  "All values are in current euros and are not adjusted for inflation or price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
